                <span id="scopeNote">
                    <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>The co-occurrence of pregnancy and <a href="/record/ui?ui=D009369" class="textLink_NEOPLASMS">NEOPLASMS</a>. The neoplastic disease may precede or follow <a href="/record/ui?ui=D005306" class="textLink_FERTILIZATION">FERTILIZATION</a>.</dd>
